Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: ttfx
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/omacom/ttfx/issues
Source: https://github.com/omacom/ttfx
Comment:
 The source package carries two trees: the program (the release tarball) and
 vendor/ (the crates from Cargo.lock, shipped as the component "vendor" so the
 build needs no network). The Files stanzas for vendor/ group the crates by
 their Cargo.toml license field; each crate's copyright holders are the authors
 named in that crate's Cargo.toml and the license files inside the crate's
 directory.
 .
 ttfx is a port of TerminalTextEffects; the release tarball's NOTICE says
 every effect, the animation engine's architecture and the command-line
 interface are that project's design.

